ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterHardsuitTarkhan = Basilisk hardsuit
    .desc = A sealed hardsuit designed by the Phaethon Dynasty and painted in a royal white palette. A rare sight.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitTarkhan = Basilisk hardsuit helmet
    .desc = A sealed helmet that completes the Basilisk hardsuit.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterHardsuitM86 = M86 hardsuit
    .desc = A bulky black hardsuit with blue trim and cyan indicators, the successor to an older, long-retired series.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitM86 = M86 hardsuit helmet
    .desc = A sealed helmet that completes the hardsuit of the same name.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterEVASuitFsb = Far Star EVA suit
    .desc = The standard-issue EVA suit aboard Far Star Biotech vessels, with dark blue plating, white shoulders and cyan indicators. It comes with two cupholders.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitFSB = Far Star EVA helmet
    .desc = A sealed helmet that completes the Far Star EVA suit.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterHardsuitMieyoCombat = Kurogane tactical suit
    .desc = A sleek black tactical hardsuit with dark red inlays, made for corporate security details.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHelmetHardsuitMieyoCombat = Kurogane suit helmet
    .desc = A sealed helmet that completes the Kurogane tactical suit.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterHardsuitVoidParamed = paramedic void suit
    .desc = A void suit made for paramedics.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetVoidParamed = paramedic void helmet
    .desc = A void helmet made for paramedics.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingOuterHardsuitMarineLeutenantTSF = TSF lieutenant hardsuit
    .desc = A sealed hardsuit of the TSF space marines with blue plating. It bears the insignia of a marine squad leader.
ent-SunriseSponsorClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitMarineLeutenantTSF = TSF lieutenant helmet
    .desc = A sealed helmet of a TSF space marine officer, with an orange visor.
